OL,3,GNEWSASex offenders face
OL,4,Aliving-in-a-council home ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the authority - which manages
OL,7,Fmore than 5,600 homes in the borough -
OL,8,Fsaid claims foreign nationals were also
OL,9,Fbanned from council accommodation were
OL,10,Fincorrect, though eligibility has been
OL,11,Ftightened up.
